error[XML001]: unescaped `<` in the value of attribute `cond`
 --> tests/ui/xml001-attribute-less-than.scxml:3:48
  |
3 |   <state id="a"><transition event="go" cond="x < 3" target="f"/></state><final id="f"/>
  |                                                ^ a literal `<` is not allowed in an attribute value
  |
  = note: the parser cannot tell a literal `<` from the start of a tag, so XML forbids it in attribute values; `>` needs no escaping
  = help: escape `<` as `&lt;` (for example `cond="x &lt; 3"`)
  = spec: XML 1.0 (Fifth Edition) §3.1 Start-Tags (WFC: No < in Attribute Values)
help: escape `<` as `&lt;`
